  "lessons_for_tiebreak_v4": [
    "Eliminate the 69.4% header tax (2842/4096 tokens): use a compact state/tool renderer so employee roster and all planted canary assignments stay inside the context window.",
    "Train calibrated stopping and abstention: supervise explicit posterior/breakeven checks (accuse only when P(top) > 1/(1+V_known) and include censored abstention trajectories).",
    "Enforce strict paired evaluation on HELDOUT_SEEDS: run base and fine-tuned models under a shared CANARY_WORLD_SECRET (or same-process world) and assert matching SHA256.",
    "Avoid naive on-policy GRPO without state-value variance control: 32GB V100 hits SDPA OOM on unchunked 4k group prefill, collapsed continue-only groups yield zero gradient, and forced-accuse single-step RL drifts in KL without closing the solver gap."
  ]
